                <invention-title lang="fr">MODULE DE CONVERSION DE PUISSANCE POLYVALENT</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">MULTI-PURPOSE POWER CONVERSION MODULE</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A power converter may comprise a magnetic core (440), a transformer primary winding (430) configured to generate a magnetic field in the magnetic core, and a transformer secondary winding matrix (450). The transformer secondary winding matrix may comprise a plurality of secondary windings (452) configurable between various electrical connections relative to one another (e.g., in series or in parallel) to adjust a voltage conversion ratio of the power converter.</p>
            </abstract>
